  "body": "Positioned just off Parkside St on a substantial 1,232sqm freehold title, more or less, overlooking Dingle Dell Reserve, the home enjoys a peaceful, private setting alive with native birdsong, while remaining just moments from the waterfront, local shops, cafes and top schools.\r\n\r\nImpressive in scale and flooded with natural light, this exceptional residence, custom built for the current owners, was conceived as a contemporary sanctuary where effortless living and entertaining take centre stage.\r\n\r\nDesigned by renowned architects Stephenson & Turner and engineered by Beca to exacting standards, this impressive approximately 499sqm residence showcases outstanding craftsmanship and enduring quality, with the home also mostly double glazed for enhanced year-round comfort.\r\n\r\nAt its heart, dramatic double height spaces open to generous multiple living areas perfect for family gatherings, catered by a designer kitchen appointed with Poggenpohl cabinetry, premium Gaggenau appliances, a generous scullery, wine fridge and a host of integrated features that will delight avid entertainers and everyday family cooks alike.\r\n\r\nA home theatre, gym, workshop, two studies, heated swimming pool and three car garaging combine to create a family home of remarkable scale and versatility.\r\n\r\nSeamless indoor/outdoor flow extends to expansive entertaining terraces, the heated swimming pool and beautifully landscaped grounds designed by Boffa Miskell. Four double bedrooms and three beautifully appointed bathrooms include a luxurious upper level master retreat with a north facing balcony overlooking the reserve.\r\n\r\nSecurely positioned behind gates and set well back from the road, the property offers extensive off-street parking for cars, boats and recreational vehicles. With exceptional flexibility for growing families, multi-generational living or hosting guests, this outstanding home represents a rare opportunity in one of St Heliers' most desirable locations.\r\n\r\nAfter many years of enjoyment, the current owners are downsizing, creating an exciting opportunity for a new family to secure and enjoy this remarkable home for years to come.",
